From 6d81e082b0f1cd31363ddc76900089e8d9a06770 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: forge-shepherd <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Jul 2026 19:11:32 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ci): revert behavioral-test workflow artifacts (avoid
 gh-aw recompile drift) [CodeRabbit #297]

The design.md->plan.md rename touched the behavioral-test agentic workflow, but its
.lock.yml is compiled by gh aw compile (not the raw text edit), causing sync-check
drift. That design.md is a legacy path (detection reads both), so revert the artifacts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .github/agentic-workflows/behavioral-test.md | 2 +-
 .github/workflows/behavioral-test.md         | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.github/agentic-workflows/behavioral-test.md b/.github/agentic-workflows/behavioral-test.md
index a3560411..b384e39e 100644
--- a/.github/agentic-workflows/behavioral-test.md
+++ b/.github/agentic-workflows/behavioral-test.md
@@ -149,7 +149,7 @@ Do not evaluate /dev, /validate, /ship, or any other stage. Score only what `/pl
 
 You must produce:
 1. A Phase 1 Q&A exchange (at minimum 3 questions and 3 answers)
-2. A design doc with all required sections, written to a concrete `docs/work/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>/plan.md`
+2. A design doc with all required sections, written to a concrete `docs/work/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>/design.md`
    artifact path that you record as `DESIGN_DOC_PATH`
 3. A Phase 3 task list with TDD steps
 
diff --git a/.github/workflows/behavioral-test.md b/.github/workflows/behavioral-test.md
index a3560411..b384e39e 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/behavioral-test.md
+++ b/.github/workflows/behavioral-test.md
@@ -149,7 +149,7 @@ Do not evaluate /dev, /validate, /ship, or any other stage. Score only what `/pl
 
 You must produce:
 1. A Phase 1 Q&A exchange (at minimum 3 questions and 3 answers)
-2. A design doc with all required sections, written to a concrete `docs/work/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>/plan.md`
+2. A design doc with all required sections, written to a concrete `docs/work/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>/design.md`
    artifact path that you record as `DESIGN_DOC_PATH`
 3. A Phase 3 task list with TDD steps
 
